<title>RUSSIA: Aeroflot to launch Moscow-Toronto charter.</title>
<headline>Aeroflot to launch Moscow-Toronto charter.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aeroflot -Russian International Airlines will begin regular non-stop charter passenger flights between Moscow and Toronto from June 20, an Aeroflot deputy chief executive said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Nikolai Lebedev said Aeroflot and a subsidiary of Canadian travel group Canadian Gateway had signed an agreement to operate the charter service.</p>
<p>Aeroflot will operate an Airbus A-310 jet with three classes of service on the Friday route, he said.</p>
<p>--Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
